      "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Overview</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>This mod introduces the <strong>JAK-12</strong>, an automatic shotgun created by <strong>Infinity Ward</strong> and inspired by the <strong>AA-12</strong> from <strong>Call of Duty</strong>.</p>\n<p>- Features <strong>basic configuration</strong> with an <strong>8-round magazine</strong>.</p>\n<p>- <strong>Models and textures</strong> are sourced from <strong>Call of Duty</strong> by Infinity Ward.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Setup and Usage</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>1. Unzip the downloaded files.</p>\n<p>2. Drop the mod folder in to the spt directory.</p>\n<p>3. Launch the game.</p>\n<p>4. Visit <strong>Mechanic’s shop</strong> or the <strong>Flea Market</strong> to find the rifle and its parts.</p>\n<p><strong>Note for MPT/Fika users:</strong></p>\n<p>If you encounter bundle loading issues (e.g., white texture or doge), manually distribute bundle files:</p>\n<p>- Copy <code>/user/mods/\\[this mod name\\]/\\[this mod name\\]/bundles</code> folder</p>\n<p>- Merge it with the <strong>same-name folder under <code>/user/cache/</code></strong></p>\n<p>This method applies to all my mods.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Permissions and Legal</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>- <strong>When reuploading or sharing this mod</strong>, please clearly indicate the author or source.</p>\n<p>- <strong>Do not distribute files with the <code>.bundle</code> extension</strong> (or its variants) from this mod without permission.</p>\n<p>- Respect the original creator’s rights</p>\n<p>- <strong>Models, Textures, Sounds, Animations:</strong> Infinity Ward (Call of Duty)</p>\n<p>- <strong>Converted Textures:</strong> John_Titor</p>\n<p>- <strong>Animation Baking:</strong> Miraki (来自二次元的公主殿下)</p>\n<p>- <strong>Tarkov Port &amp; Code:</strong> <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/18902-massivesoft/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Massivesoft</a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Known Issues</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>- Some animations may look a little weird.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>- <strong>Models, Textures, Sounds, Animations:</strong> Infinity Ward (Call of Duty)</p>\n<p>- <strong>Converted Textures:</strong> John_Titor</p>\n<p>- <strong>Animation Baking:</strong> Miraki (来自二次元的公主殿下)</p>\n<p>- <strong>Mod Author:</strong> <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/18902-massivesoft/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Massivesoft</a> (ported everything into Tarkov, built unity assets, tweaked animations, created code, etc.)</p></div></div></div>\n",
